{"id":"635659","name":"煮米粉","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/635659/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蟹味菇","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"空心菜叶","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"高汤","amount":"一碗"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好干米粉。","img":"images/635659/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅烧水，水开后，下入米粉煮熟。","img":"images/635659/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮好后，焖10分钟就好了，过凉水，清洗干净(多洗几遍)。","img":"images/635659/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"另起锅，放入一碗高汤，大火烧开，加盐、生抽、蚝油调味。","img":"images/635659/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"磕入一个鸡蛋，煮成荷包蛋。","img":"images/635659/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入肉片(肉肉提前用淀粉抓匀)和蟹味菇。","img":"images/635659/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入米粉，再次大火烧开。","img":"images/635659/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入鸡精调味。","img":"images/635659/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入空心菜叶烫熟。","img":"images/635659/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起锅盛出。","img":"images/635659/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"好了，简单又美味。","img":"images/635659/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}